        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jffdougan/{size}/1882_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-18T19:39:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My kindergartener has begun to be interested, perhaps because her brother dressed as Bunker for Halloween. The three of us ran about 90% of an app-driven game last night after dinner, where she insisted on being Bunker. (He's O-X; I'm... having a lapse of memory. Wraith, maybe.) Ambuscade &amp; Insula Primalis.</p><p>It's hard to keep her Bunker-loving brother from dictating her plays, but I think she's having fun so far. Hard to tell yet how much she's actually understanding, but that's for a Saturday when we can put the cards out across the dining room table &amp; let her take as long as she wants to read the cards.</p>",
