      {
        "id": 153521,
        "name": "Rabit",
        "username": "Rabit",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-18T19:51:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I'm surprised your friends didn't play along with their kids. &nbsp;<span></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n \n<p><span>Partially because they have a newborn baby (and needed to deal with it), partially because they were socializing with my spouse, and partially because they weren't sure this was their kind of game.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span>I'll keep working on them…&nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> </span></p>\n<span>\n[quote=\"UXM266\"]\n</span>\n<p><em>start sarcasm</em> So a huuuge thanks goes out to GtG for making a game too unbalanced when it's not played properly, where the recommendations are written on the box, in the rule book, and on your website. Thanks for that! <em>end sarcasm</em> &nbsp;<span><br>\n[/quote]<br>\n</span></p>\n<p><span><em><em>sigh</em> </em>Yeah, one of the things we've done at cons over the years is wander around, looking for folks playing the game. I've lost count of how many times we've found two people playing with two heroes. Usually, they're just confused at how hard it is, but when we explain the situation they are generally very thankful.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=12\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> &nbsp;(Even had one person come to the booth the next day with candy and drinks as thanks for saving them from their frustration!  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> )</span></p>\n<span>\n[quote=\"Pydro\"]\n</span>\n<p>Just a side not, KNYFE does has some Ongoing removal.<span><br>\n[/quote]<br>\n</span></p>\n<p><span>Yeah, but it isn't useful when it doesn't come up!&nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> </span></p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:32:52.505Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
