        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"Powerhound_2000\"]\n\nI&#39;m surprised your friends didn&#39;t play along with their kids. &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">\n[/quote]\n </span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Partially because they have a newborn baby (and needed to deal with it), partially because they were socializing with my spouse, and partially because they weren&#39;t sure this was their kind of game.&nbsp;</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">I&#39;ll keep working on them...&nbsp; :wink: </span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">\n[quote=\"UXM266\"]\n</span>\n\n*start sarcasm* So a huuuge thanks goes out to GtG for making a game too unbalanced when it&#39;s not played properly, where the recommendations are written on the box, in the rule book, and on your website. Thanks for that! *end sarcasm* &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">\n[/quote]\n </span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\"><em>*sigh* </em>Yeah, one of the things we&#39;ve done at cons over the years is wander around, looking for folks playing the game. I&#39;ve lost count of how many times we&#39;ve found two people playing with two heroes. Usually, they&#39;re just confused at how hard it is, but when we explain the situation they are generally very thankful.  :slightly_smiling_face: &nbsp;(Even had one person come to the booth the next day with candy and drinks as thanks for saving them from their frustration!  :open_mouth: )</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">\n[quote=\"Pydro\"]\n</span>\n\nJust a side not, KNYFE does has some Ongoing removal.<span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">\n[/quote]\n</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">Yeah, but it isn&#39;t useful when it doesn&#39;t come up!&nbsp; :wink: </span>",
