        "created_at": "2016-01-19T02:47:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My wife and I brought the game to a party and played a five-person game against Citizen Dawn. She put up one of her better fights: she started with the upper hand, and after a three-hour throw-down we won with the plink off incapacitated Chrono-Ranger (played by one of the new people). We were constantly shouting and whooping, and the other guests playing Blokus and Stone Age all agreed that whatever we were doing, it looked like the most fun.</p>",
